I"!<p>Scanning a QR code on a digital credential takes a verifier directly to the live credential record, bypassing any risk of an altered or forged document being presented. It’s the fastest and most accessible verification method available, requiring nothing more than a smartphone.</p>

<p>This article explains exactly how the process works, step by step, and the role a digital wallet plays in storing and sharing credentials.</p>

<p><br /></p>

